From 78ba854c4098889c8164edc9f191ed4f12e784eb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dimitry B <dimitryB@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 19:15:49 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] feat(evm): add Hemi default stablecoins

Without a default asset, "$0.01" pricing throws on Hemi mainnet and
testnet, and client spend controls reject Hemi USDC.e. Mainnet USDC.e
supports EIP-3009; the testnet token has neither EIP-3009 nor EIP-2612,
so it uses Permit2, as Igra's entry does.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
